name: ['Abbot of Keral Keep', "Accorder's Shield", 'Canopy Vista', 'Chord of Calling', 'Cinder Glade', 'Cyclonic Rift', 'Deathrite Shaman', 'Eidolon of Blossoms', 'Golgari Charm', 'Gruul Charm', 'Izzet Charm', "Judge's Familiar", 'Obzedat, Ghost Council', 'Omnath, Locus of Rage', 'Orzhov Charm', 'Prairie Stream', 'Shrapnel Blast', 'Simic Charm', 'Smoldering Marsh', 'Sunken Hollow', 'Sylvan Scrying', "Thespian's Stage", 'Voice of Resurgence', 'Worldspine Wurm', 'Xenagos, God of Revels']
